WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.003 --> 00:00:02.603
Start a new book

2
00:00:03.111 --> 00:00:06.681
To start a book, choose New book.

3
00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:19.025
Give it a title. If you are stuck, describe the book and press Suggest for ideas.

4
00:00:19.028 --> 00:00:21.969
Choose the pen name it is published under.

5
00:00:21.972 --> 00:00:31.657
Leave this ticked to get a title page, copyright, contents and the other usual pages, ready to fill in.

6
00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:36.282
Your book opens on the Write tab, with the first chapter ready for you.
